----------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE / PARITY (the web source is THE spec — read end to end)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The web component is a presentational leaf fed four props by its parent
(DrivetrainHealthPage): `sensors` (4 thermal readings, °C), `overallHealth`
(good|warning|critical), `healthScore`, `peakPower` (kW). It renders six
`MetricCard`s in a grid-cols-2 / sm:3 / lg:6:
  • 4 sensor cards — value=displayTemp(°C→display, inline °unit, null→'—'),
    subtitle=`${fmtNumber(value/maxTemp*100,0)}% of max` | 'No data',
    accent=tempNeonColor(value,maxTemp) (green/amber/red), icons Zap/Zap/Cpu/
    BatteryCharging, ceilings 150/150/120/60.
  • Health Score card — value=`${healthScore}%`, icon Heart, accent good→green
    / warning→amber / critical→red.
  • Peak Power card — value=peakPower>0 ? `${fmtInt(peakPower)} kW` : '—',
    icon Zap, accent purple.
Hooks: useTranslation (P1/S10), useUnits (temperature formatting only). Data
arrives via props → the native surface binds the shared P1/S8 state-holder
seam (no HTTP in the view) and owns the full lifecycle, rendering every state.

Files shipped (all match TemperatureMetricCards.*; delegation FORBIDDEN — authored directly):
  TemperatureMetricCards.swift            — entry view: header + freshness chip + phase switch + states
  TemperatureMetricCards.Model.swift      — P1/S8 source seam + @Observable model + P1/S11 telemetry + P1/S10 facade
  TemperatureMetricCards.Adapter.swift    — value types + °C→display + fmtNumber/safe + inline-temp (Foundation-only)
  TemperatureMetricCards.Projection.swift — 6-card projection (sensor catalog, neonAccent, health, peak) + a11y
  TemperatureMetricCards.Views.swift      — chrome: chip, banner, tile, grid, skeleton, error, empty hint
  TemperatureMetricCards.Previews.swift   — per-state previews (content/empty/loading/error/stale/offline, °C/°F)
  TemperatureMetricCards.strings          — P1/S10 catalog contribution (table "TemperatureMetricCards")
  TemperatureMetricCards.Tests.swift      — adapter + model + a11y XCTest

States rendered (no hidden surfaces): loading (skeleton) / empty (em-dash cards
+ hint) / error (retry) / stale (chip+banner+auto-refresh once/episode) /
offline (cached + chip) / content. Per-card web branches reproduced: null→'—' +
'No data'; percent-of-max uses the RAW Celsius ratio; peak ≤0 → '—'.

